  (text "ADCIN1=ADCIN2=LDO_1V5: decoded 5/5. Verify dead-battery startup/address with the final TI configuration.\nEEPROM is 0x50. I2Cc is private to the PD controller, EEPROM and charger.\nThe spinal cord uses the I2Ct interface and TI bridge commands, not a second controller on I2Cc."
